│  Local Development                                       │
│  .env file (git-ignored) → dotenv loads into process    │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
          │
          ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  CI/CD Pipeline (GitHub Actions, Jenkins, etc.)         │
│  Secrets stored in pipeline → injected as env vars      │
│  at build/deploy time (never written to disk)           │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
          │
          ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  Production (Kubernetes / Cloud)                        │
│  Secret Manager (Vault / AWS SM) → fetched at runtime   │
│  via API with IAM auth → injected into container        │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘   

